WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A welcome screen offers a choice of learning levels.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The home screen shows a daily teaching.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The First Noble Truth lesson opens the story of Kisa Gotami.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The meditation screen lists sessions.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
A quiet sit begins.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The app returns from the meditation session.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The prayer library opens.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
The loving-kindness prayer player shows its timer advancing.
